From 5ef6546dedc8c3b34a6d3dee6c2e95cf81010ee3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 21:42:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ghidra): admit m68k for headerless raw-binary loads

Map m68k to Ghidra 68000:BE:32:default, require 2-byte entry alignment,
bound the mapping to a 32-bit address width, and keep Hopper declining it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0192KZ8mX83JSgXEpwagjMis
